Z||000000||3fifty||06-28-2001||02:41 AM||||I am adding the ralley gauges to my 85 GT.<BR>I am going to use the battery and oil pressure gauge on the aux set. I want to cut<BR>the needle off of the oil pressure gauge under the tach and put the led for my alarm<BR>in the white face cover where the pressure gauge was. After looking at the back of the cluster it looks like the tach and pressure<BR>gauge may run through the same circuit. How<BR>do I disable the pressure gauge? Thanks ||||reg||5
