Z||000003||Tweek||06-28-2001||04:50 AM||||Yep, if you take a look at the pic below from TheFiero64's car (see thread: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/005191.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/005191.html</A>  ) You can see that there is a speedo style with no extra gauge, I believe this was normal is a car equipped with aux. gauges from the factory, at least it would make sense. Now in this pic he has got a white face for it, but you get the idea. Also I think these ones are "backlit" and not the reflectorized kind like yours and mine, so I'm not sure if you can just replace the gause itself, you may have to replace to whole assembly (speedo, temp, gas and tach) I dunno.  Good Luck.<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=9233482&p=37735136&Sequence=0&res=high"> ||||reg||7
